{
  "_about": "lean (from 2026-10-27): diet plus lower reasoning effort where the work is a fix or a brainstorm. Opus at high effort only where quality is decided (script draft, storyboard, animatic screening); Sonnet at medium effort for hooks and every fix round (most of a fix's output was thinking: 60k tokens to change a few scenes); Haiku for ranking, cover, lessons and card text. Measured plan: vault Docs/Token Budget.md",
